creatures:
- name: Marilith
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 16  
      **Hit Points** 220 (rollable(dice=21d10 + 105,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 40 ft., Climb 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Initiative) (20)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** cold, fire, lightning  
      **Damage Immunities** poison  
      **Condition Immunities** poisoned  
      **Senses** truesight 120 ft., Passive Perception 18  
      **Languages** Abyssal; telepathy 120 ft.  
      **Challenge** 16 (15,000 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +5  

      ## Traits

      ***Demonic Restoration.*** If the marilith dies outside the Abyss, its body dissolves into ichor, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its ***Hit Points*** somewhere in the Abyss.

      ***Magic Resistance.*** The marilith has ***Advantage*** on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.

      ***Reactive.*** The marilith can take one ***Reaction*** on every turn of combat.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The marilith makes six Pact Blade attacks and uses Constrict.

      ***Pact Blade.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=To Hit [Pact Blade]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d10+5,dicelabel=Damage [Pact Blade]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Pact Blade]) Necrotic damage.

      ***Constrict.*** *Strength Saving Throw:* DC 17, one Medium or smaller creature the marilith can see within 5 feet. *Failure:* rollable(dice=2d10+4,dicelabel=Damage [Constrict]) Bludgeoning damage. The target has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 14), and it has the ***Restrained*** condition until the grapple ends.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Teleport (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Teleport])).*** The marilith teleports up to 120 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.

      ## Reactions

      ***Parry.*** *Trigger:* The marilith is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. *Response:* The marilith adds 5 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

